soul-anil-seth-nicolas-rothen = "Anil Seth (living; Sussex; perception as controlled hallucination; the Dreamachine) and Nicolas Rothen (UniDistance Suisse; author of the 2026 Open Encyclopedia of Cognitive Science entry on synesthesia). With Bor, Schwartzman and Clayton they trained grapheme-colour synesthetic experience into adults (2014). Relevance: their own result is the trained synesthesia language-is-trained-synesthesia generalizes; the open question they leave is exactly Avik's claim."
